WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.821
DFIR is a team activity.

00:00:02.821 --> 00:00:11.716
The incident commander coordinates the response, keeps priorities clear, and helps the organization move from confusion to ordered work.

00:00:11.716 --> 00:00:17.140
This role does not have to be the deepest technical expert.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:27.337
It does need authority, calm communication, and the ability to manage decisions, status updates, and handoffs while specialists investigate and recover systems.

00:00:27.337 --> 00:00:32.327
Forensic analysts focus on evidence, timelines, technical findings, and scope.

00:00:32.327 --> 00:00:40.789
Security operations teams triage alerts, monitor for related activity, and may provide detection coverage during and after containment.

00:00:40.789 --> 00:00:49.251
IT operations teams understand production systems, backups, dependencies, identity platforms, endpoint management, and the practical consequences of changes.

00:00:49.251 --> 00:00:56.410
Business owners understand which services matter most and what downtime means for customers or operations.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:01:04.004
Legal, compliance, privacy, communications, human resources, and leadership may also need involvement depending on the incident.

00:01:04.004 --> 00:01:08.126
Their job is not to replace technical analysis.

00:01:08.126 --> 00:01:15.720
Their job is to handle obligations, messaging, employment considerations, customer commitments, regulatory timelines, and business risk.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:24.182
A technically accurate response can still fail if stakeholders receive conflicting information or if required notifications are missed.

00:01:24.182 --> 00:01:27.002
Coordination prevents confusion during incidents.

00:01:27.002 --> 00:01:41.105
Teams should agree on where notes are kept, who approves containment actions, how evidence is labeled, when leadership receives updates, and what language is used for confirmed facts versus working hypotheses.

00:01:41.105 --> 00:01:45.661
Clear communication reduces duplicate work and prevents accidental harm.

00:01:45.661 --> 00:01:50.217
In a stressful incident, structure is a security control.
